491" class="external text" id="mwM40">astro-ph/0512491</a></span>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)" title="Bibcode (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwM44">Bibcode</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2006AJ....132..290B" class="external text" id="mwM48">2006AJ....132..290B</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwM5A">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1086%2F504422" class="external text" id="mwM5E">10.1086/504422</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwM5I">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM5M"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:119386667" class="external text" id="mwM5Q">119386667</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Astronomical+Journal&amp;rft.atitle=Orbits+and+Photometry+of+Pluto%27s+Satellites%3A+Charon%2C+S%2F2005+P1%2C+and+S%2F2005+P2&amp;rft.volume=132&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=290-298&amp;rft.date=2006&amp;rft_id=info%3Aarxiv%2Fastro-ph%2F0512491&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A119386667%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1086%2F504422&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F2006AJ....132..290B&amp;rft.aulast=Buie&amp;rft.aufirst=Marc+W.&amp;rft.au=Grundy%2C+William+M.&amp;rft.au=Young%2C+Eliot+F.&amp;rft.au=Young%2C+Leslie+A.&amp;rft.au=Stern%2C+S.+Alan&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+natural+satellites" class="Z3988" about="#mwt25" id="mwM5U"></span>. <i id="mwM5Y">a, i, e</i> per <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/?sat_elem#pluto" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="http://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/?sat_elem#pluto" id="mwM5c">JPL